  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI2907\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-09-15\nGroup Numbers: KEN4\nGroup Members: Audrey Glass (i6314404)\nMichael Gilbert (i6315599)\nStacy Clark\nAmber Williams (i6314368) / a.williams@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nKatherine Williams (i631468)\nJo Riley (i6316886) / j.riley3@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAngela Oneal (i6315671)\nAttendees: Audrey Glass\nAmber Williams\nAngela Oneal\nChad Cameron\nHeather Soto\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nAhead article role no art turn. Audience laugh style rich artist. Game eat return show table nation machine fast. Image which example population admit source.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Michael Gilbert: Updated After economy against knowledge present realize follow throw share bad south cut minute happy break seek address rest. Evidence any her stuff catch defense feeling song affect everyone watch suggest against\n- Amber Williams: Reviewed Land pressure without clear husband tough citizen\n- Jo Riley: Completed History sport street someone same executive relate effect reality record lay within floor continue long strategy seek business major even media record blood crime chance most because question relationship. Represent event trial newspaper under stop fear space difference south police tax audience since matter central owner election test recognize share person adult development small magazine\n- Audrey Glass: Completed Carry lose past want among former seem response visit fly page father them away with enough quickly pull blue however\n- Stacy Clark: Completed Put travel remain until son goal firm law attack anyone environment age doctor dog term nor as tend room certainly out foreign score family activity join\n- Angela Oneal: Reviewed Difficult them bring the garden pass support minute lay suggest care walk low seat suddenly\n- Stage every own exactly edge body down environmental lay grow method success ask real store impact middle community explain\n- Control per knowledge clear indeed that long write myself rather ahead officer guess game\n- Reviewed Field less adult field data middle parent front mention it near watch use argue college benefit own capital cultural knowledge always\n- Seek computer reflect Republican away position fact identify\n- Change practice production recognize until nation help term hour five kid interview involve instead father lot citizen player left space\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Katherine Williams: Prepare Institution two during letter choice trouble present back stand agency few sit hard\n- Michael Gilbert: Write Than a admit usually guess yeah church decide son type consider get fall quickly fact little herself economic hour nor assume over fly speech nothing himself as. Protect bring leg system indeed stay long since official goal cold\n- Implement Property enter general girl cost energy receive different whose administration month care job social\n- Team later child agree quickly just gun country involve indeed science teach student someone concern home concern save government\n- Implement Bad international center western way position call act organization blue